    "comment": "Generated by the build (RQ-BLD-022, ADR-BLD-004 DEC-BLD-019). The product version and the pinned dependency versions come from CMake, so they cannot drift from what was actually built; the component LIST is curated by hand and stays so until a generator exists that understands CMake FetchContent -- GitHub's dependency-graph SPDX export does not, and would omit JUCE, this product's largest dependency. The created field is the commit's own timestamp, not the build clock, so rebuilding a commit yields a byte-identical document."
  },
